<%@ include file="head.jspf" %>
<section class="form-layout"><div><h1>Apa yang perlu diperbaiki?</h1><p>Kirim masukan tentang katalog atau pengalaman belajarmu. Pengelola dapat membacanya melalui halaman Kelola data.</p><p>Formulir ini menyimpan pesan ke database lokal, bukan mengirim email. Hindari data pribadi atau informasi sensitif.</p></div>
<form action="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/contact" method="post" class="panel"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="${csrf}"><label for="name">Nama</label><input id="name" name="name" maxlength="80" autocomplete="name" required value="<c:out value='${param.name}'/>"><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="160" autocomplete="email" required value="<c:out value='${param.email}'/>"><label for="comment">Masukan</label><textarea id="comment" name="comment" maxlength="2000" rows="6" required><c:out value="${param.comment}"/></textarea><button type="submit">Kirim masukan</button><p class="loading" role="status" hidden>Sedang menyimpan masukan…</p></form></section>
<%@ include file="foot.jspf" %>
